Package: linuxscp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, python3
Description: graphical and console file transfer client (SFTP, FTP, WebDAV, S3)
 LinuxSCP is the native Linux port of WinSCP, providing both an interactive
 command-line interface and a dual-pane Norton Commander graphical client
 (linuxscp-gui).
 .
 Supports SFTP, SCP, FTP, FTPS, WebDAV, and Amazon S3 with interrupted
 transfer resume, recursive directory synchronization, public-key
 authentication, and full batch script compatibility.
